{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07457","headline":"上巳日越中与鲍侍郎泛舟耶溪 · 刘长卿","name":"上巳日越中与鲍侍郎泛舟耶溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰桡缦转傍汀沙，应接云峰到若耶。\n旧浦满来移渡口，垂杨深处有人家。\n永和春色千年在，曲水乡心万里赊。\n君见渔船时借问，前洲几路入烟花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}